Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Restore vanilla ender pearl loading

Ported from LophineLabs/Lophine 0130-Restore-vanilla-ender-pearl-loading
(at 0724ba3f; ver/26.2 number 0049), author Bacteriawa. Restores vanilla
ender pearl loading on Folia: pearls are tracked per player again and
saved into player data (vanilla ender_pearls layout) using a region-owned
volatile snapshot (lastSavedEnderPearlTag) updated on the pearl's own
region thread, so player saves never read cross-region entity state.
Quit removal is scheduled through the pearl's entity task scheduler.
Adaptation: contexts regenerated against Canvas applied sources after
0129 removed the Canvas SavedData mechanism.

